t night.</li><li>Premium Interior Finishes - A layered material palette featuring Arbescato Orobico marble, white travertine, light oak veneer, champagne hairline metal, leather, and tinted bronze mirror.</li><li>Smart Home Integration - Every villa includes integrated smart home technology, with the wider community supported by EV charging, smart irrigation, and solar lighting.</li><li>Freehold Ownership - Open to both residents and international investors, with full freehold title within the community.</li><li>Starting Price - Villas at Tilal Binghatti Dunes start from AED 4.2M, offering a competitive entry point into a premium gated villa community in Academic City.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2171,"cta":{"id":3006,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_Location_1_c3d92e0519.jpg","hash":"Map_Location_1_c3d92e0519","name":"Map-Location-1.jpg"},"style":null,"title":null,"heading":"location","bg_color":null,"add_place":[{"id":31,"place_name":"Meydan Racecourse","time_distance":"10 Minutes "},{"id":32,"place_name":"Dubai Creek Harbour","time_distance":"15 Minutes "},{"id":33,"place_name":"Burj Khalifa & Dubai Mall","time_distance":"17 Minutes"},{"id":34,"place_name":"DXB International Airport","time_distance":"18 Minutes "},{"id":35,"place_name":"Museum of the Future","time_distance":"20 Minutes"},{"id":36,"place_name":"Palm Jumeirah","time_distance":"35 Minutes "}],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":null,"design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":5088,"url":"","file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/brochure_e2b966e506.pdf","hash":"brochure_e2b966e506","name":"brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d6